{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20452",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 3.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.77,
      "end_seconds": 9.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Alright, come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.77,
      "end_seconds": 21.32,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "so, I've been waking at night with my hand numb, doctor i didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.21,
      "end_seconds": 23.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.1,
      "end_seconds": 26.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "For four weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.6,
      "end_seconds": 31.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.66,
      "end_seconds": 36.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.97,
      "end_seconds": 39.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.73,
      "end_seconds": 72.4,
      "duration_seconds": 31.67,
      "text": "It, It usually comes with tingling in my thumb and first two fingers. The tingling in my thumb and first two fingers? That's been for about a month. So, as for tingling in my thumb and first two fingers, honestly, every other day. I, I had an ache in my wrist before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.87,
      "end_seconds": 78.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Any weight loss, neck pain or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.07,
      "end_seconds": 81.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.44,
      "end_seconds": 86.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.04,
      "end_seconds": 87.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.35,
      "end_seconds": 91.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.21,
      "end_seconds": 95.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.69,
      "end_seconds": 103.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.89,
      "end_seconds": 113.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Well, I'm on something called thyr... thyroxine, 75 micrograms, maybe, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.97,
      "end_seconds": 120.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.21,
      "end_seconds": 131.75,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "not with me i'll bring it next time. Metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.39,
      "end_seconds": 135.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.15,
      "end_seconds": 139.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.39,
      "end_seconds": 143.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Right, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.26,
      "end_seconds": 147.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.22,
      "end_seconds": 151.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.86,
      "end_seconds": 156.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.61,
      "end_seconds": 173.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.09,
      "end_seconds": 179.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Yes, plasters. I get a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.72,
      "end_seconds": 199.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "What about your medical history? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.59,
      "end_seconds": 205.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "I've got an underactive thyroid. I've had diabetes, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.13,
      "end_seconds": 209.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.77,
      "end_seconds": 217.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "alright, diabetes, that matches what I have here. Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.51,
      "end_seconds": 226.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.94,
      "end_seconds": 230.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.09,
      "end_seconds": 235.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I mean, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.75,
      "end_seconds": 243.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.81,
      "end_seconds": 252.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "sit still for a a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.57,
      "end_seconds": 285.62,
      "duration_seconds": 13.05,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.6 degrees, weight 94 kilos, saturation 97 percent. And BMI works out to 40.2, blood pressure 118 over 77, heart rate 67, height 153 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.74,
      "end_seconds": 290.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.58,
      "end_seconds": 294.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.16,
      "end_seconds": 320.17,
      "duration_seconds": 9.01,
      "text": "Tapping over the wrist brings on the tingling, and the muscle at the base of the thumb looks slightly thin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.14,
      "end_seconds": 324.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.27,
      "end_seconds": 341.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "putting it all together, this is probably carpal tunnel syndrome"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.68,
      "end_seconds": 344.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.59,
      "end_seconds": 358.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like carpal tunnel syndrome, but I'd like to confirm. I'm going to order nerve conduction tests, for hand numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 362.14,
      "end_seconds": 365.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.75,
      "end_seconds": 380.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.68,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange blood tests for numbness. A wrist splint at night will often settle it. I'd like you to see occupational therapy as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.23,
      "end_seconds": 382.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.42,
      "end_seconds": 394.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.65,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.82,
      "end_seconds": 399.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.97,
      "end_seconds": 417.57,
      "duration_seconds": 14.6,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: the numbness spreads or you notice more weakness. In that case don't wait. Let's plan a check after the nerve test. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.93,
      "end_seconds": 422.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 423.93,
      "end_seconds": 425.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}